# Playable build version (required)

Players must always be able to see which build they are running. Other agents on this repo must follow the same rule.

## Source of truth
- `playable/package.json` → `"version"` is the only version number to edit.
- UI and tooling import it via `playable/src/version.ts` (`APP_VERSION` / `APP_VERSION_LABEL`).
- Do **not** hardcode `0.x.y` strings in HUD, menus, or copy.

## On every playable change that players can notice
1. Bump `playable/package.json` version (patch for fixes/polish, minor for larger features).
2. Keep the root `README.md` title line version in sync (`Painted Abyss — First Dive · x.y.z`).
3. Keep the on-screen `BUILD v…` badge visible on the **menu and during the dive** (see `main.tsx` + `.build-version` in `style.css`). Do not remove it.
4. Rebuild `playable/dist` so `node playable/serve.mjs` serves the new version.
5. Mention the new version in the PR summary so playtesters know what to look for.

## Playtest note for humans
Terminal should print `Painted Abyss vX.Y.Z ready`. The game UI shows `BUILD vX.Y.Z`. If those differ from GitHub `main`, kill old servers on port 5173 and re-pull / restart.
